* ''Codex carries the lanes'' (operator, 2026-11-07: //"Shift more work onto Codexs please."//). Lane leads run Codex by default; a Claude lead stands only where a lane needs custody or ward reds, and the blind Opus read stays on every custody slice. Failed CI logs go to a Codex read seat, never the controller's context, and a read seat's brief names its attachments by absolute path (the broker-owned seat directory receives only the brief).

